    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clement Herron Real Estate is pleased to welcome this spacious four-bedroom property to the sales market, ideally located in the popular and well-established development of Alexandra Walk, Clane, Co. Kildare.\r\n\r\nThis attractive property offers generous and versatile accommodation arranged over three floors, making it an ideal home for families or those seeking additional living and working space.\r\n\r\nThe property is conveniently located close to Clane village, which offers an excellent range of amenities including supermarkets, shops, cafés, restaurants, pubs, sporting and leisure facilities. Families are also well catered for, with a selection of primary and secondary schools in the surrounding area.\r\n\r\nClane enjoys excellent transport links, with convenient access to the M4 and M7 motorway networks, while rail services are available from nearby Sallins and Maynooth, providing connections to Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from off-street parking, gas-fired central heating and a low-maintenance rear garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall – 4.103m x 1.902m\r\nWelcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring, alarm, teak front door, coving, carpeted stairs and useful under-stairs storage.\r\n\r\nSitting Room – 3.653m x 4.285m\r\nComfortable sitting room featuring a gas fire, curtains and curtain poles.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nFully tiled walls and floor, splash area, W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area – 5.245m x 5.713m\r\nSpacious kitchen and dining area with tiled flooring and fitted kitchen, providing an excellent space for everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUtility Room – 1.590m x 1.480m\r\nTiled flooring, worktop, plumbed for appliances and gas boiler.\r\n\r\nBathroom – 5.872m x 2.422m\r\nGenerously proportioned bathroom featuring a corner bath, separate corner shower, W.C. and W.H.B., with fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two – 3.840m x 3.633m\r\nDouble bedroom with wooden flooring, built-in wardrobe, curtains and curtain poles.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom – 3.617m x 4.175\r\nSpacious master bedroom benefiting from its own private balcony and en-suite.\r\n\r\nBalcony – 3.692m x 1.563m\r\nPrivate balcony accessed from the master bedroom.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite – 1.945m x 1.728m\r\nFully tiled floor and walls, shower, W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three – 3.462m x 3.835m\r\nLocated on the top floor, with wooden flooring, built-in wardrobe, curtains, curtain poles and blinds.\r\n\r\nBedroom Four – 4.617m x 3.815m\r\nAlso located on the top floor, this generously sized bedroom features wooden flooring, built-in wardrobe, curtains, curtain poles and blinds.\r\n\r\nImportant Notice: Some images used in the marketing of this property have been digitally modified and/or enhanced using Artificial Intelligence (AI). These images are for illustrative purposes only and may not accurately represent the property's current appearance, contents, furnishings or finishes. Prospective purchasers should rely on their own inspection of the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Four-bedroom property arranged over three floors\r\nGas-fired central heating\r\nConvenient location close to Clane village\r\nMature scenic walks on your door step along the Liffey \r\nShort walk to the Westgrove Hotel\r\nLow density living.\r\nOff street parking for up to 4 cars\r\nWest facing garden\r\nNatural Stone Patio to rear\r\nCobble lock front drive"
      },
